{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_152159_p49_b27", "persona_id": "db:49", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "1. 面对客户对软件更新的硬性要求，必须给出具体年限和官方政策依据，并用封闭式问题引导确认。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_153125"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_152159_p49_b27", "persona_id": "db:49", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "2. 当客户提出具体功能疑问（如第三方App兼容性），应坦诚告知现状并提供替代方案，而非回避或转移话题。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_153125"}
